OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fpleasant evening sunshine to come and
OL,7,Fremaining dry and fine overnight with
OL,8,Flengthy clear skies. A few mist and
OL,9,Ffog patches forming under the clear
OL,10,Fskies, with temperatures falling into
OL,11,Fsingle figures in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,14,Fsunny spells, especially in the west.
OL,15,FEastern areas may see cloud
OL,16,Foccasionally move in from the North
OL,17,FSea.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
