OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FStaying mostly dry on Tuesday, before
OL,7,Fit turn unsettled during midweek with
OL,8,Fbands of rain and showers moving
OL,9,Facross the area. The rain potentially
OL,10,Fturning heavy and thundery at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
